 ~[thread_path_callsites]: "&[cli] — conditional on ?[detect_vs_thread]: pulse.ts and form-geometry.ts pass the repo-relative path at their snapshotTopography call sites; fixture: pulse tally on a copied wip fixture is stable under a prose edit"
 ~[detect_plan_stream]: "^seed[dialect] — likely dropped by ~[entry_line_all_dialects]; conditional on ?[detect_vs_thread]: detectDialect reads a plan-stream signature so pathless parse (stdin, LSP) picks Spw.p; negative control over docs that quote an entry"
 ~[template_dialect_pragma]: ".[plans] — conditional on ?[template_pragma]: stamp the dialect pragma in wip-template.spw and the plan:init scaffold; a plan:stream round-trip case in test-agent-tools.sh"
 ~[post_fix_tally]: "![plans] — record the post-fix health tally over every wip.spw in the stream and compare with the baseline in this plan"
